#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Removes stutters from the base game when working with large, packed storage, without changing how it plays."
msgstr "在不改变玩法的前提下，消除游戏本体在处理大型满载仓库时的卡顿。"

#: manual/building.md:1
msgid "Building"
msgstr "构建"

#: manual/building.md:4
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "需求"

#: manual/building.md:6
msgid "*Probably Stolen*, game version 0.46D. The build compiles against the game's own assemblies in `Probably Stolen_Data/Managed`."
msgstr "《深空当铺：可能是偷的》（*Probably Stolen*）游戏版本 0.46D。构建时会引用 `Probably Stolen_Data/Managed` 中的游戏程序集。"

#: manual/building.md:7
msgid "Git Bash or another POSIX shell on Windows."
msgstr "Windows 上的 Git Bash 或其他 POSIX shell。"

#: manual/building.md:8
msgid "The Roslyn C# compiler from Visual Studio Build Tools. The C# 5 compiler that ships with Windows cannot read some of the game's types."
msgstr "Visual Studio Build Tools 中的 Roslyn C# 编译器。Windows 自带的 C# 5 编译器无法读取游戏的部分类型。"

#: manual/building.md:10
msgid "Build"
msgstr "构建"

#: manual/building.md:17
msgid "Two environment variables override the defaults:"
msgstr "可以用两个环境变量覆盖默认值："

#: manual/building.md:19
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: manual/building.md:19
#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: manual/building.md:22
msgid "the Roslyn `csc.exe` of Visual Studio 18 Build Tools"
msgstr "Visual Studio 18 Build Tools 中的 Roslyn `csc.exe`"

#: manual/building.md:24
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/building.md:26
msgid "The decisions that need neither Unity nor the game live in `src/*.Pure.cs`, and each has a test in `tests/` that compiles with `csc` alone:"
msgstr "不需要 Unity 也不需要游戏的判断逻辑放在 `src/*.Pure.cs` 里，每个都在 `tests/` 里有一个只用 `csc` 就能编译的测试："

#: manual/building.md:32
msgid "Test"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/building.md:32
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "检查内容"

#: manual/building.md:34
msgid "The buying rule on small stores, nesting past the depth limit (no answer, so the game's own check runs), refusal, each item asked once, and 2,000 random stores against the rule as it reads"
msgstr "小型店铺上的收货规则、超过深度上限的嵌套（不给出答案，于是由游戏自己的判定执行）、拒收、每件物品只问一次，以及 2000 个随机店铺与规则原文的对照"

#: manual/building.md:35
msgid "While a save loads: each item is listed once however often it is redrawn, the part ends with one pass that redraws it and its containers once each, and gone items are skipped"
msgstr "读档时：每件物品无论被重画多少次都只记一次，这一部分结束时一次遍历，把它和它的容器各重画一次，已不存在的物品跳过"

#: manual/building.md:36
msgid "Which UI parts are created in place: exactly the create, load this, getter or field of this, move sequence, nothing in between"
msgstr "哪些界面部件原地生成：恰好是“生成、加载 this、getter 或 this 的字段、移动”这一序列，中间没有别的"

#: manual/building.md:37
msgid "When an inventory layout waits for the end of the frame and when it runs at once"
msgstr "库存布局何时等到帧末、何时立即执行"

#: manual/building.md:38
msgid "When the group-drag fit check must run again"
msgstr "成组拖动时何时需要重新判断能否放下"

#: manual/building.md:39
msgid "Which highlight squares are switched off after a refresh"
msgstr "刷新后关掉哪些高亮格"

#: manual/building.md:40
msgid "Which patches a fix that fails halfway removes again"
msgstr "中途失败的修复要撤掉哪些补丁"

#: manual/building.md:41
msgid "The steps of the load timeline: in time order with the gap since the step before, each kept at its first time, nothing outside a trip"
msgstr "读档时间线的各步骤：按时间顺序，记录与上一步的间隔，每步保留首次的时间，一次进店之外不记录"

#: manual/building.md:42
msgid "When the buyer check may be installed, given the game's language"
msgstr "根据游戏语言，何时可以安装收货判定"

#: manual/building.md:44
msgid "Each test prints `ok` or `FAIL` per case and exits with a non-zero code if any case fails."
msgstr "每个测试对每个用例输出 `ok` 或 `FAIL`，只要有一个用例失败就以非零代码退出。"

#: manual/building.md:46
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "语言"

#: manual/building.md:48
msgid "The options' text is in `Localization/`, one file per game language, named by the game's locale code: `en`, `zh`, `ja`, `ko`, `de`, `fr`, `es`, `it`, `pl`, `ru` and `ptBR`. A missing line falls back to English."
msgstr "选项文字在 `Localization/` 里，游戏的每种语言一个文件，以游戏的语言代码命名：`en`、`zh`、`ja`、`ko`、`de`、`fr`、`es`、`it`、`pl`、`ru` 和 `ptBR`。缺少的条目回退为英文。"

#: manual/building.md:50
msgid "Install by hand"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: manual/building.md:52
msgid "Copy the folder `out/performance_fixes` into the game's `Mods` folder, start the game, and enable the mod in the Mods menu. Mods load when the game starts, so restart after enabling or updating one."
msgstr "把 `out/performance_fixes` 文件夹复制到游戏的 `Mods` 文件夹，启动游戏，在模组菜单中启用它。模组在游戏启动时加载，所以启用或更新后要重启游戏。"

#: manual/building.md:54
msgid "The mod declares no capabilities, so the game enables it without a permission prompt."
msgstr "这个模组不声明任何权限，游戏启用它时不会弹出权限确认。"

#: manual/cost.md:1
msgid "Cost analysis"
msgstr "成本分析"

#: manual/cost.md:3
msgid "How much work each fix removes, in terms of the sizes involved. For each fix: what the game does and what that costs, what the fix does and what it costs instead, what was measured, and whether the result is the same as the game's."
msgstr "每项修复省去了多少工作，用所涉及的规模来表示。每项修复都说明：游戏怎么做、代价是多少，修复怎么做、代价变成多少，实测数据，以及结果是否与游戏相同。"

#: manual/cost.md:5
msgid "Most fixes remove repeated work: the same item, inventory or highlight worked out again and again with the same inputs. Where the order of growth stays the same and only a repeated pass or a constant per step goes away, this page says so. Times were measured in game on one large store and are given to show scale, not as guarantees for every store."
msgstr "大多数修复去掉的是重复工作：同一件物品、同一个库存或同一处高亮，用相同的输入一遍又一遍地计算。如果增长的阶数不变，只是去掉了一遍重复或每步的一个常数，本页会照实说明。时间是在一个大型店铺上实测的，用来说明量级，并不保证每个店铺都一样。"

