#: manual/cost.md:51
msgid "**Game.** Every floating window is under one canvas, and Unity rebuilds a canvas as a whole. Any change in any window, an item moving or a slot lighting up under the mouse, re-batches every graphic of every open window: O(g · W) per change."
msgstr "**游戏。** 所有浮动窗口都在同一块画布下，而 Unity 是整块重建画布的。任何窗口里的任何变化，一件物品移动或鼠标下一个格子亮起，都会把所有打开窗口的全部图形重新合批：每次变化 O(g · W)。"

#: manual/cost.md:53
msgid "**Fix.** Each container window gets its own nested canvas, so a change re-batches only its own window: O(g) per change. The order of growth per window is the same; the factor W, the other open windows, goes away."
msgstr "**修复。** 每个容器窗口有自己的嵌套画布，一次变化只重新合批它所在的窗口：每次变化 O(g)。单个窗口的增长阶数不变，去掉的是 W 这个因子，也就是其他打开的窗口。"

#: manual/cost.md:55
msgid "**Result.** Identical: same draw order, pixels-per-unit and shader channels, and clicks still reach the window."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：绘制顺序、每单位像素数和着色器通道都一样，点击仍然能到达窗口。"

#: manual/cost.md:59
msgid "**Game.** Opening a window moves it from its home under the floating-window canvas, and closing it moves it back. Each move makes every graphic in the window re-register: O(g) per open and per close."
msgstr "**游戏。** 打开窗口时，游戏把它从原处移到浮动窗口画布下，关闭时再移回去。每次移动都让窗口里的每个图形重新注册：每次打开和关闭 O(g)。"

#: manual/cost.md:61
msgid "**Fix.** A closed window stays where it is. The first open still costs O(g); after that, opening only brings it to the front, a constant amount of work."
msgstr "**修复。** 关闭的窗口留在原地。首次打开仍是 O(g)；之后打开只需把它移到最前，是常数量的工作。"

#: manual/cost.md:63
msgid "**Measured.** About 140 ms of the 280 ms stutter of the storage-preset hotkey, which opens four full windows at once."
msgstr "**实测。** 存储预设快捷键一次打开四个满载窗口，280 毫秒的卡顿里约 140 毫秒来自这里。"

#: manual/cost.md:65
msgid "**Result.** Identical. A window is kept only within its own scene and goes home before it is destroyed."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同。窗口只在它自己的场景里保留，销毁前会先回到原处。"

#: manual/cost.md:69
msgid "**Game.** Hiding a window deactivates it, and showing it activates it again: every component in it is switched off and on, O(g) each way."
msgstr "**游戏。** 隐藏窗口会停用它，显示时再启用：里面的每个组件都要关了又开，每次 O(g)。"

#: manual/cost.md:71
msgid "**Fix.** The window's own canvas and raycaster are switched off instead: constant work per hide and per show. The first open of each window still costs O(g)."
msgstr "**修复。** 改为关掉窗口自己的画布和射线检测器：每次隐藏和显示都是常数量的工作。每个窗口首次打开仍是 O(g)。"

#: manual/cost.md:73
msgid "**Measured.** About 110 ms each way for one large storage window before; nearly instant after its first open."
msgstr "**实测。** 修复前，一个大型存储窗口每次开或关约 110 毫秒；首次打开之后几乎瞬间完成。"

#: manual/cost.md:75
msgid "**Result.** Identical: the game's own hide steps run in the same order, and the window answers \"not visible\" as before."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：游戏自己的隐藏步骤按同样的顺序执行，窗口照旧回答「不可见」。"

#: manual/cost.md:79
msgid "**Game.** The storage-preset hotkey opens or closes all W windows of a preset in one frame: O(g · W) in that frame."
msgstr "**游戏。** 存储预设快捷键在一帧内打开或关闭预设的全部 W 个窗口：这一帧 O(g · W)。"

#: manual/cost.md:81
msgid "**Fix.** The same windows open or close one per frame, the first at once. **This fix does not reduce the work**: the total stays O(g · W). It spreads it over W frames, so no single frame does more than O(g) and animations keep moving."
msgstr "**修复。** 同样的窗口改为每帧打开或关闭一个，第一个立即处理。**这项修复并不减少工作量**：总量仍是 O(g · W)。它只是把工作分摊到 W 帧里，每帧不超过 O(g)，动画不会停住。"

#: manual/cost.md:83
msgid "**Result.** Identical: each window's tab selection is applied right after its own opening, and pressing the hotkey again finishes any pending windows first."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：每个窗口的标签页选择紧接在它自己打开之后应用，再次按下快捷键会先处理完尚未打开的窗口。"

