#: manual/cost.md:141
msgid "On the 1,342-item store, starting the game fresh before each load and loading the same save each time, click to first frame took about 7.8 s and 8.2 s without this mod and 4.64 s and 4.77 s with it. Without the mod there is no load timeline, so those two times are the main-thread stalls the game's own watchdog logged (7.5 s and 7.9 s) plus 0.3 s, the difference between the watchdog and the timeline on loads where both were written."
msgstr "在 1,342 件物品的店铺上，每次读档前都重启游戏、每次读同一个存档，从点击到首帧，不用此模组约 7.8 秒和 8.2 秒，用此模组 4.64 秒和 4.77 秒。不用此模组时没有读档时间线，所以这两个时间是游戏自己的卡顿监视器记录的主线程卡住时长（7.5 秒和 7.9 秒）加上 0.3 秒，即两者都有记录的读档中监视器与时间线的差值。"

