msgid "the rest of the store's start, the settings among it, and the first frame"
msgstr "商店启动的剩余部分（其中包括设置）和首帧"

#: manual/cost.md:153
msgid "**Game.** Before the save loads, the game reads the store's whole entry, S bytes, into a new store object to look at u of its upgrades, and drops it; the real load then reads the whole entry again. Both reads build every string and object in S, mostly the JSON of every inventory: 2 · O(S) in time and in what is built."
msgstr "**游戏。** 读档之前，游戏把商店这一整项，S 字节，读进一个新的商店对象，只为查看其中 u 个升级，然后丢掉；真正读档时再把整项读一遍。两次读取都会建出 S 里的每个字符串和对象，主要是每个库存的 JSON：时间和建出的东西都是 2 · O(S)。"

#: manual/cost.md:155
msgid "**Fix.** The early look passes over everything but the upgrades. Passing over still reads every character of S, so **the order of growth stays O(S)**; what goes away is building the strings and objects of the rest, O(S) of allocation, leaving O(u). The real load is unchanged."
msgstr "**修复。** 提前查看时只读升级，其余都跳过。跳过仍要读 S 的每个字符，所以**增长阶数仍是 O(S)**；去掉的是为其余部分建字符串和对象，即 O(S) 的分配，只剩 O(u)。真正的读档不变。"

#: manual/cost.md:157
msgid "**Measured.** With the load timed method by method, the early look fell from 131 ms to 147 ms down to 79 ms to 81 ms."
msgstr "**实测。** 逐个方法计时读档时，提前查看从 131 到 147 毫秒降到 79 到 81 毫秒。"

#: manual/cost.md:159
msgid "**Result.** Identical: the upgrades are read by Easy Save's own reader exactly as before, and nothing else of the early copy is read by the game."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：升级由 Easy Save 自己的读取器照原样读出，提前读出的副本里其他内容游戏都不读。"

#: manual/cost.md:163
msgid "**Game.** Entering the store writes K = 57 settings and key bindings one at a time. Each write reads the settings file, F bytes, merges in its one value, writes a temporary file and swaps it in: O(K · F) read and O(K · F) written, and K file swaps, which cost far more than the bytes. Nearly every value is the one already in the file."
msgstr "**游戏。** 进入商店时，游戏把 K = 57 项设置和按键绑定逐个写入。每次写入都要读设置文件（F 字节），合并进这一个值，写一个临时文件再替换：读 O(K · F)、写 O(K · F)，替换文件 K 次，而替换文件比读写这些字节贵得多。写入的几乎都是文件里已有的值。"

#: manual/cost.md:165
msgid "**Fix.** Each value is first read back: still K reads, O(K · F), but **only a setting that changed is written**, so in the usual case nothing is written and nothing is swapped."
msgstr "**修复。** 每个值先读回来：仍是读 K 次，O(K · F)，但**只有改动过的设置才写入**，所以通常什么都不写，也不替换文件。"

#: manual/cost.md:167
msgid "**Measured.** With the load timed method by method, the settings step fell from 496 ms to 10 ms: 0 written, 57 left out. The time from the end of the save load to the first frame fell from about 540 ms to about 155 ms."
msgstr "**实测。** 逐个方法计时读档时，写设置这一步从 496 毫秒降到 10 毫秒：写入 0 项，跳过 57 项。从读档结束到首帧的时间从约 540 毫秒降到约 155 毫秒。"

#: manual/cost.md:169
msgid "**Result.** Identical: a write is left out only where the file already holds the same key with the same value, so the file ends the same."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：只有文件里已经有相同的键和相同的值时才不写，所以文件最后完全一样。"

#: manual/cost.md:173
msgid "**Game.** After leaving the store, R references keep pointing at it, and any one of them keeps the whole store, all its items, inventories and windows, in memory until the next store replaces each reference. Each later load in the same session starts with that memory still in use."
msgstr "**游戏。** 离开商店后，有 R 处引用仍指向它，其中任何一处都会让整个商店，包括它所有的物品、库存和窗口，一直留在内存里，直到下一个商店把每处引用都替换掉。同一局游戏里之后的每次读档开始时，这些内存都还占着。"

#: manual/cost.md:175
msgid "**Fix.** When another scene replaces the store, the R references are let go, O(R), and memory is collected once while the menu is idle. **This fix does not make a load faster by itself**: it stops the memory of each store left from staying in use until the next one."
msgstr "**修复。** 当别的场景替换商店时，放开这 R 处引用，O(R)，并在菜单空闲时回收一次内存。**这项修复本身不会让读档变快**：它让每个离开的商店不再一直占着内存，直到下一个商店出现。"

#: manual/cost.md:177
msgid "**Measured.** In the store, 237 MB of managed memory were in use; after leaving it and a full collection, 158 MB, with one left-behind holder found, a list of three destroyed cameras in the game's own letterbox manager."
msgstr "**实测。** 在商店里，托管内存用了 237 MB；离开后完整回收一次，是 158 MB，只找到一处残留的引用：游戏自己的黑边管理器里一个装着三个已销毁摄像机的列表。"

#: manual/cost.md:179
msgid "**Result.** Identical: each reference is cleared only where the game no longer reads it."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：每处引用只在游戏不再读取它的地方才清掉。"

#: manual/cost.md:181
#: manual/customers.md:1
#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "Customers"
msgstr "顾客"

#: manual/cost.md:185
msgid "**Game.** To decide whether a customer buys a container, the game lists every item anywhere inside it and runs the full check on each one, and each of those lists and checks everything inside itself again. An item k levels below the container is reached once for every combination of the containers between them, so it can be checked up to 2^(k−1) times, and every listing builds a new list. For the shallow nesting of most stores this looks roughly quadratic; it grows much faster with depth."
msgstr "**游戏。** 为了判断顾客是否收购一个容器，游戏列出里面任何位置的每件物品，对每件执行完整的检查，而每件又会把自己里面的一切再列出、再检查一遍。容器下方 k 层的一件物品，对它们之间容器的每一种组合都会被走到一次，所以最多会被检查 2^(k−1) 次，而且每次列举都要新建一个列表。大多数店铺嵌套很浅，看起来大致是平方级；嵌套越深，增长得快得多。"

#: manual/cost.md:187
msgid "**Fix.** The same rule is evaluated bottom-up once per item per call: O(N) for N items inside, plus one walk over the contents. Answers are kept only within that one call. Contents nested more than 32 levels deep get no answer from this rule, and the game's own check runs for that call instead."
msgstr "**修复。** 同一条规则自下而上求值，每次调用中每件物品一次：里面有 N 件物品就是 O(N)，再加一次遍历内容物。答案只在这一次调用里保留。嵌套超过 32 层的内容物，这条规则不给答案，这次调用改由游戏自己的检查执行。"

#: manual/cost.md:189
msgid "**Measured.** Not timed separately. The rule is checked outside the game against a plain version of the game's rule on 2,000 random stores, with the same answer every time (see [Building](building.md))."
msgstr "**实测。** 没有单独计时。这条规则在游戏外与一个照原文实现的游戏规则在 2,000 个随机店铺上对照，答案每次都相同（见[构建](building.md)）。"

#: manual/cost.md:191
msgid "**Result.** Identical: the same answers for the current state."
msgstr "**结果。** 相同：对当前状态给出同样的答案。"

#: manual/customers.md:5
msgid "**Problem.** When the game decides whether the customer will buy an item (`StoreClient.IsClientBuyingThisItem`), it also checks a container's contents. It lists every item anywhere inside, runs the full check on each one, and each of those lists and checks its own contents again. An item k levels below the container can be checked up to 2^(k−1) times, and every level allocates a new list; for shallow storage that looks roughly quadratic, and it grows much faster with depth."
msgstr "**问题。** 游戏判断顾客是否收购一件物品时（`StoreClient.IsClientBuyingThisItem`），也会检查容器里的内容物。它列出里面任何位置的每件物品，对每件执行完整的检查，而每件又会把自己的内容物再列出、再检查一遍。容器下方 k 层的一件物品最多会被检查 2^(k−1) 次，而且每一层都要新建一个列表；存储较浅时看起来大致是平方级，嵌套越深，增长得快得多。"

#: manual/customers.md:7
msgid "The game runs this check when an item is placed on the counter, when it decides whether something can be sold, and in the negotiation screen, once for every item in the back inventory."
msgstr "游戏会在这些时候运行这个检查：把物品放上柜台、判断能否出售，以及讨价还价界面，后者会对后仓中的每件物品各运行一次。"

#: manual/customers.md:9
msgid "**Fix.** The rule, read from the game's code:"
msgstr "**修复。** 从游戏代码中读出的规则如下："

#: manual/customers.md:11
msgid "an item is **bought** when it is acceptable on its own (the game's own check with `ignoreContents`) and, if its contents are checked, everything inside it is bought;"
msgstr "物品本身可接受（游戏自己带 `ignoreContents` 的检查），并且如果要检查内容，里面的东西全都会被收，这件物品才 **会被收**；"

#: manual/customers.md:12
msgid "contents are **checked** unless the item is currently locked, has no content window, or is an advanced gun."
msgstr "除非物品当前上锁、没有内容窗口或是高级枪械，否则都会 **检查内容**。"

#: manual/customers.md:14
msgid "`IsClientBuyingThisItem` and `IsClientRefusingItem`, in the forms that include contents, are patched to evaluate exactly that rule bottom-up, once per item per call. Answers are reused only within that call, never across calls or frames, so the result is always the game's own for the current state. The single-item form runs unchanged."
msgstr "模组修改了包含内容检查的 `IsClientBuyingThisItem` 和 `IsClientRefusingItem`，让它们自底向上严格按这条规则计算，每次调用中每件物品只算一次。结果只在本次调用内复用，从不跨调用或跨帧，所以结果始终与游戏对当前状态的判断一致。只检查单件物品的版本保持原样。"

#: manual/customers.md:16
msgid "Contents nested more than 32 levels deep get no answer from the rule. For such a call the game's own check runs instead, and its checks of the items inside come back through the fix one level down each time, so even then the answer is the game's."
msgstr "嵌套超过 32 层的内容物，规则不给出答案。这样的调用改由游戏自己的判定执行，它对内部物品的判定又会逐层回到本修复，所以即便如此，答案也是游戏自己的。"

#: manual/customers.md:18
msgid "**When it starts.** The game's own check uses a list of localized water names that the game fills in the first time it is needed. Installing the fix fills it in too, and mods start before the game applies the player's language. So the fix waits until the language the game chose at startup is applied, and only then installs. If that has not happened within five minutes, the fix stays off for the session and `Player.log` says so. Without this wait, water names would stay in English for the session and water would stop selling in any other language."
msgstr "**何时启动。** 游戏自己的判定会用到一份本地化的水名列表，游戏在第一次用到时才填写它。安装本修复也会让它被填写，而模组启动时游戏还没有应用玩家的语言。所以本修复会等到游戏启动时选定的语言生效后才安装。如果五分钟内仍未生效，本修复在这次游戏中保持关闭，`Player.log` 里会写明。没有这一步等待，水的名称会在整局里保持英文，在其他语言下水也会卖不出去。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:1
#: manual/index.md:26
#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:3
msgid "Long-frame log"
msgstr "长帧日志"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:5
msgid "With **Log long frames** on, frames longer than 100 ms are written to the game's `Player.log` as `[PerformanceFixes] long frame: ...`, with the container window opened just before, if any, and counters for each fix. It costs nothing."
msgstr "打开 **记录长帧** 后，超过 100 毫秒的帧会以 `[PerformanceFixes] long frame: ...` 写入游戏的 `Player.log`，附带刚刚打开的容器窗口（如果有）以及各项修复的计数。没有任何开销。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:7
msgid "`Player.log` is in `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Questing Goose Studio\\Probably Stolen`."
msgstr "`Player.log` 位于 `%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Questing Goose Studio\\Probably Stolen`。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:9
msgid "Load timeline"
msgstr "读档时间线"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:11
msgid "Every trip from the main menu into the store writes one line to `Player.log`, with every option on or off:"
msgstr "每次从主菜单进入商店，都会向 `Player.log` 写一行，无论各选项开关如何："

#: manual/diagnostics.md:17
msgid "Each step is the time since the one before, starting from the button press: the fade reaching black, the store's scene set up, the save starting and finishing to load, and the first frame drawn after it. Loading a save also writes a line with the items in each inventory and the counts of the loading fixes, and entering the store writes how many settings were written and how many were left out. Leaving the store writes the memory before and after it is freed."
msgstr "每一步是距上一步的时间，从按下按钮开始：淡出到黑屏、商店场景搭建完成、存档开始读取和读取完成、之后画出的首帧。读档时还会写一行，列出每个库存的物品数和各项读档修复的计数；进入商店时会写出写入了多少项设置、跳过了多少项。离开商店时会写出释放前后的内存。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:19
msgid "Long-frame profiler"
msgstr "长帧分析器"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:21
msgid "**Profile long frames** goes further. While it is on, every per-frame callback of the game's MonoBehaviours, every layout pass (`Validate`) and everything the shop's main update calls, four levels deep, is timed, along with Unity's UI rebuild and rendering. Each frame over 100 ms is then logged with its slowest methods:"
msgstr "**分析长帧** 更进一步。开启期间，游戏所有 MonoBehaviour 的每帧回调、每次布局计算（`Validate`），以及店铺主更新往下四层调用的所有方法都会被计时，Unity 的 UI 重建和渲染也会单独计时。每个超过 100 毫秒的帧都会连同最慢的方法一起记录下来："

#: manual/diagnostics.md:27
msgid "Times are inclusive: a method that calls others includes them. The profiler adds a little overhead, so leave it off for normal play. It never lets a failure reach the game: if it cannot attach to a method, it skips it, and if it cannot start, it removes everything it attached."
msgstr "时间是包含式的：调用了其他方法的方法，其耗时包含被调用的部分。分析器有少量开销，正常游玩时请关闭。它绝不会让故障影响游戏：挂不上某个方法就跳过，无法启动就撤掉所有已挂上的计时。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:29
msgid "When a fix cannot attach"
msgstr "修复无法挂载时"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:31
msgid "After a game update, a fix may no longer find a method it patches. It then removes the patches it had already attached, so it is either fully on or fully off, and writes one line to `Player.log`: `[PerformanceFixes] <fix> is off: ...`. The other fixes keep working."
msgstr "游戏更新后，某项修复可能找不到它要打补丁的方法。这时它会撤掉自己已经挂上的补丁，所以要么完全生效，要么完全关闭，并在 `Player.log` 里写一行：`[PerformanceFixes] <fix> is off: ...`。其他修复照常工作。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:33
msgid "Regenerating the method lists"
msgstr "重新生成方法列表"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:35
msgid "The timed methods are listed in generated files, so the game's mod scanner sees every type named in code and asks for no permission:"
msgstr "被计时的方法列在自动生成的文件中，这样游戏的模组扫描器能在代码里看到每个被引用的类型，不会请求权限："

#: manual/diagnostics.md:37
msgid "`tools/GenProbe.cs` writes `src/Targets.g.cs`, the per-frame callbacks and layout passes."
msgstr "`tools/GenProbe.cs` 生成 `src/Targets.g.cs`，即每帧回调和布局计算。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:38
msgid "`tools/GenCallees.cs` writes `src/Callees.g.cs`, everything the given methods call, to a given depth."
msgstr "`tools/GenCallees.cs` 生成 `src/Callees.g.cs`，即指定方法在指定深度内调用的所有方法。"

#: manual/diagnostics.md:40
msgid "Both leave out the game's mod loader, mod security and Steam integration, which mods may not patch. Regenerate them after a game update."
msgstr "两者都会排除游戏的模组加载器、模组安全和 Steam 集成部分，因为模组不允许修改它们。游戏更新后需要重新生成。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Performance Fixes"
msgstr "性能修复"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "Smoother shop, same game. This mod removes stutters from the base game when you work with large, packed storage. Every fix keeps the game's behaviour and only removes wasted work."
msgstr "店铺更流畅，玩法不变。这个模组消除游戏本体在处理大型满载仓库时的卡顿。每项修复都保持游戏原有行为，只去掉浪费的计算。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "![Performance Fixes cover](../attachments/cover.png)"
msgstr "![性能修复封面](../attachments/cover.png)"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "Every fix has its own switch in the mod's options: open the Mods menu, select Performance Fixes and click the gear icon. All of them are on by default except the profiler."
msgstr "每项修复在模组设置里都有独立开关：打开模组菜单，选中性能修复，点击齿轮图标。除分析器外，所有修复默认开启。"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Section"
msgstr "分组"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

