msgstr "开"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "Each container window is drawn on its own canvas, so a change in one window no longer redraws every open window."
msgstr "每个容器窗口画在自己的画布上，一个窗口有变化时不再重绘所有打开的窗口。"

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "A closed window stays in the floating-window layer, so reopening it does not move its contents between canvases."
msgstr "关闭的窗口留在浮动窗口层，重新打开时不用在画布之间搬动内容。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "A closed container window stops being drawn instead of having everything inside switched off, so reopening a full window is nearly instant. Needs the two options above."
msgstr "关闭的容器窗口只是不再绘制，而不是停用里面的所有内容，所以重新打开满载窗口几乎是瞬间的。需要上面两项。"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "The storage-preset hotkey opens or closes its windows over a few frames, the first at once, so animations keep running."
msgstr "存储预设快捷键分几帧开关窗口（第一个立即开关），动画不会卡住。"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "Each inventory is re-laid out once per frame instead of once per item change."
msgstr "每帧每个库存只重新布局一次，而不是每个物品变动都布局一次。"

#: manual/index.md:18
msgid "While a save loads, each item's look is worked out once per inventory instead of dozens of times."
msgstr "读档时，每件物品的外观在每个库存里只计算一次，而不是几十次。"

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "The parts of items, windows, inventories and machine panels are created where they belong instead of being created elsewhere and moved."
msgstr "物品、窗口、库存和机器面板的部件直接在所属位置生成，而不是先在别处生成再移过去。"

#: manual/index.md:20
msgid "Working out an item's shape and state skips the search under an item that has nothing under it."
msgstr "计算物品的形状和状态时，下面什么都没有的物品跳过查找。"

#: manual/index.md:21
msgid "The highlight under selected items is updated in place instead of being redrawn every frame, so holding or dragging a large selection no longer stutters."
msgstr "选中物品下的高亮原地更新，不再每帧重画，框选或拖动大批物品时不再卡顿。"

#: manual/index.md:22
msgid "The early look at a save's store reads only the upgrades it checks instead of the whole store."
msgstr "读档前提前查看商店时，只读要检查的升级，而不是整个商店。"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "Entering the store no longer rewrites the settings file for settings that already hold the same value."
msgstr "进入商店时，已经是相同值的设置不再重写设置文件。"

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "Leaving the store lets go of everything that still pointed at it, so the next load does not start with the old store in memory."
msgstr "离开商店时放开所有仍指向它的引用，下次读档不会带着旧商店的内存开始。"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "The customer's buying check on containers runs once per item instead of re-checking every level."
msgstr "顾客对容器的收货判定每件物品只算一次，而不是每层都重查。"

#: manual/index.md:26
msgid "Log long frames"
msgstr "记录长帧"

#: manual/index.md:26
msgid "Writes frames over 100 ms to `Player.log` with the window opened just before."
msgstr "把超过 100 毫秒的帧和刚打开的窗口写入 `Player.log`。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Profile long frames"
msgstr "分析长帧"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Breaks frames over 100 ms down by method. Slows the game slightly."
msgstr "按方法拆解超过 100 毫秒的帧。会让游戏略微变慢。"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "If anything looks wrong, turn off the option for that area and report what you saw."
msgstr "如果发现异常，先关掉对应部分的选项，再反馈你看到的现象。"

#: manual/index.md:31
msgid "The fixes"
msgstr "各项修复"

#: manual/index.md:33
msgid "[Windows](windows.md): separate canvases, windows kept in place, instant hiding and staggered presets."
msgstr "[窗口](windows.md)：独立画布、窗口原地保留、瞬间隐藏和预设逐个打开。"

#: manual/index.md:34
msgid "[Inventories](inventories.md): one layout per inventory per frame, the selection highlight updated in place, each item checked once while a save loads, UI built in place and lighter shape checks."
msgstr "[库存](inventories.md)：每个库存每帧只布局一次，选中高亮原地更新，读档时每件物品只检查一次，界面原地生成，以及精简形状检查。"

#: manual/index.md:35
msgid "[Loading](loading.md): the whole load with and without this mod, the lighter store preload, unchanged settings left unwritten, and the store freed when you leave it."
msgstr "[读档](loading.md)：用与不用此模组时的整个读档，精简商店预读，跳过未改动的设置，以及离开商店时释放它。"

#: manual/index.md:36
msgid "[Customers](customers.md): the buying check in one pass."
msgstr "[顾客](customers.md)：一次遍历完成收货判定。"

#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "[Cost analysis](cost.md): how much work each fix removes, in terms of the sizes involved."
msgstr "[成本分析](cost.md)：每项修复省去了多少工作，用所涉及的规模来表示。"

#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "[Diagnostics](diagnostics.md): the long-frame log, the load timeline and the profiler that found all of the above."
msgstr "[诊断](diagnostics.md)：长帧日志、读档时间线，以及找出以上所有问题的分析器。"

#: manual/inventories.md:5
msgid "**Problem.** `GameItem.ValidateShapeState` runs whenever an item enters or leaves an inventory and on every tag change (`EnableTag`, `DisableTag`, `ModifyTag`). After laying out the item, it calls `Validate` on the item's whole inventory, which lays out every item in it again. Adding n items costs n × n layouts."
msgstr "**问题。** 每当物品进出库存，以及每次标签变化（`EnableTag`、`DisableTag`、`ModifyTag`）时，都会运行 `GameItem.ValidateShapeState`。它在布局完这件物品后，会对物品所在的整个库存调用 `Validate`，把里面每件物品重新布局一遍。放入 n 件物品就要 n × n 次布局。"

#: manual/inventories.md:7
msgid "One save load in a large store ran 161,804 item layouts and 7,000 inventory layouts in a single frame, about 1.8 s. A single tag change on an item in a full storage bay re-lays out the whole bay, and opening a container is one such tag change (`OPENED_TAG`)."
msgstr "在一个大型店铺里读一次档，单帧内就运行了 161,804 次物品布局和 7,000 次库存布局，约 1.8 秒。满载储物舱里任何一件物品改一个标签，整个储物舱都会重新布局，而打开容器本身就是这样一次标签变化（`OPENED_TAG`）。"

#: manual/inventories.md:9
msgid "**Fix.** While `ValidateShapeState` runs, the inventory layouts it asks for are only recorded. The item's own layout, and everything else, still happens immediately. The recorded inventories are laid out once, just before Unity renders the frame (`Canvas.willRenderCanvases`). What reaches the screen is the same, but repeated requests in one frame cost one layout."
msgstr "**修复。** `ValidateShapeState` 运行期间，它请求的库存布局只是被记录下来；物品自己的布局和其他所有事情仍然立即完成。记录下来的库存会在 Unity 渲染这一帧之前（`Canvas.willRenderCanvases`）统一布局一次。屏幕上看到的结果相同，但同一帧内的重复请求只花一次布局。"

#: manual/inventories.md:11
msgid "An inventory laid out directly in the meantime is dropped from the list, and an inventory whose UI was destroyed since is skipped."
msgstr "期间被直接布局过的库存会从列表中移除，界面已被销毁的库存会被跳过。"

#: manual/inventories.md:15
msgid "**Problem.** While items are selected, and all the while they are dragged as a group, the game redraws the highlight under them every frame. It switches off every highlight square it lit the frame before and then lights the squares under each selected item again. Each square that goes off and on is rebuilt and its canvas re-batched, every frame. To find each item's slot, the game also looks the item up in a fresh copy of its inventory's item list, so n selected items in an inventory of m items copy n × m entries per frame. A large selection in a full storage bay stutters the whole time it is held or dragged."
msgstr "**问题。** 选中物品时，以及成组拖动的整个过程中，游戏每帧都会重画它们下面的高亮：先关掉上一帧点亮的所有高亮格，再把每件选中物品下的格子重新点亮。每个关了又开的格子都要重建，所在画布也要重新合批，每帧如此。为了找到每件物品的位置，游戏还要在其库存物品列表的一份新副本里查找它，于是 m 件物品的库存里选中 n 件，每帧要复制 n × m 项。在满载的存储架里选中一大批物品，按住或拖动期间会一直卡顿。"

#: manual/inventories.md:17
msgid "Over the items' own container, a group drag is always a precise placement (elsewhere only with Shift held), and the game also redraws the placement preview every frame in the same way. To colour the preview, it checks every selected item against every item in the container, and for each of those it searches the list of selected items, which is n × m × n steps per frame. This is why dragging inside the original container stuttered most."
msgstr "在物品所在的原容器上方，成组拖动总是精确摆放（在别处要按住 Shift），游戏还会用同样的方式每帧重画摆放预览。为了给预览上色，它把每件选中物品和容器里的每件物品逐一比对，每比一件还要在选中列表里查找一遍，每帧共 n × m × n 步。所以在原容器里拖动卡得最厉害。"

#: manual/inventories.md:19
msgid "**Fix.** The same squares are lit in the same way, and then only the squares lit the frame before that are not lit now are switched off. A square that stays lit is not touched, so the highlight looks exactly as before and an unchanged selection costs almost nothing. Each item's slot is kept between frames while the item stays in the same inventory with the same shape, so the item list is no longer copied every frame."
msgstr "**修复。** 以同样的方式点亮同样的格子，然后只关掉上一帧亮着、这一帧不再亮的格子。一直亮着的格子不会被动到，所以高亮看起来和原来完全一样，选中内容不变时几乎没有开销。物品留在同一库存、形状不变时，它的位置在帧与帧之间保留，物品列表不再每帧复制。"

#: manual/inventories.md:21
msgid "The placement preview is updated in place in the same way. Whether the group fits is worked out again only when the drop position, the selection, or an item in any inventory changes. Every other condition is still checked each frame, and the drop itself still runs the game's own check."
msgstr "摆放预览也同样原地更新。只有落点、选中内容或任一库存里的物品有变化时，才重新判断整组能否放下。其余条件仍然每帧检查，真正放下时仍由游戏自己的判断执行。"

#: manual/inventories.md:25
msgid "**Problem.** A save is decoded in eleven parts, one per inventory. Each part builds its items, restores their tags, runs about fifteen load steps on every item (machines, locks, plants, water sprites and more) and moves the items into the inventory. Every tag change and every move recomputes the item's shape and state and then redraws the item's look; redrawing an item also redraws every container it is inside, and every inventory layout redraws all its items again. In a store of 1,342 items that came to about 58,000 shape checks and 62,000 redraws, over a second of the load: each item's look worked out about 45 times."
msgstr "**问题。** 存档分十一部分解码，每个库存一部分。每部分先生成物品，恢复它们的标签，对每件物品执行约十五个读档步骤（机器、锁、植物、水的贴图等），再把物品放进库存。每次改标签、每次移动都会重新计算物品的形状和状态，然后重画物品的外观；重画一件物品会连带重画它外面的每个容器，而每次库存布局又会把其中所有物品再重画一遍。在一个有 1,342 件物品的店铺里，这加起来约有 58,000 次形状计算和 62,000 次重画，占去读档一秒多：每件物品的外观要算约 45 次。"

#: manual/inventories.md:27
msgid "**Fix.** The redraws of one part are combined into a single pass, at the end of that same part of the load: each item that asked to be redrawn is redrawn once, in the order it first asked, then the containers around it once each; items destroyed during the part are skipped. Everything else runs exactly where and as often as in the game: shapes and states, placement, inventory layouts (they also set sizes and slot positions that later shape computations read) and every load step, none of which reads an item's look. An item's look is worked out from its current shape, state and contents, so the one pass gives what the game's last redraw gives."
msgstr "**修复。** 每一部分的重画合并为一次遍历，就在读档的这一部分结束时：每件请求过重画的物品按最先请求的顺序重画一次，再把它外面的容器各重画一次；这一部分期间被销毁的物品跳过。其余一切都与游戏完全一样地执行，位置和次数都不变：形状和状态、摆放、库存布局（它们还会设置尺寸和槽位位置，之后的形状计算会读取），以及每个读档步骤，而它们都不读取物品的外观。物品的外观由它当前的形状、状态和内容物算出，所以这一次遍历的结果，与游戏最后一次重画相同。"

#: manual/inventories.md:29
msgid "Each load writes one line to `Player.log`, with or without the option: `[PerformanceFixes] save load: ... ms`, the number of redraws asked for and run, and the number of items in each part's inventory. Loading the same save with the option on and off shows that the same items were loaded. With the other fixes on, the time it saves is too small to measure: the redraws it removes had already become cheap (see [Cost analysis](cost.md))."
msgstr "每次读档都会向 `Player.log` 写一行，无论此选项开关：`[PerformanceFixes] save load: ... ms`、请求和实际执行的重画次数，以及每部分所在库存的物品数。同一个存档在选项开和关时各读一次，可以看出读出的物品相同。其他修复都开着时，它省下的时间小到测不出来：它去掉的重画已经变得很便宜（见[成本分析](cost.md)）。"

#: manual/inventories.md:33
msgid "**Problem.** Every item's look is made of thirteen parts, and windows, inventories and machine panels are built the same way. The game creates each part in a shared temporary place and then moves it to where it belongs. Moving a part inside the game's interface is slow, about 80 µs each whatever the part holds, so a save of 1,342 items spent most of 2.3 s moving the parts of items, and about 0.9 s more moving the parts of windows, inventories and machine panels. The same happens whenever many of them are created."
msgstr "**问题。** 每件物品的外观由十三个部件组成，窗口、库存和机器面板也是这样构建的。游戏先在一个共用的临时位置生成每个部件，再把它移到所属位置。在游戏界面里移动一个部件很慢，无论部件里装了什么，每次约 80 µs，所以一个 1,342 件物品的存档，2.3 秒里大部分时间花在移动物品的部件上，另外还有约 0.9 秒花在移动窗口、库存和机器面板的部件上。每当大量生成这些东西时都是如此。"

#: manual/inventories.md:35
msgid "**Fix.** In 33 of the game's builders (items, windows, inventories, machine panels and their widgets), 132 kinds of part are created directly where they belong, and the game's own move then finds them already in place. A part ends up with the same parent, the same place among its siblings and the same position, rotation and scale as before, and it starts up the same way, because everything it is created under has just been made by the same builder and is active. The first part of each builder is created as before. If a game update changes how many parts a builder makes this way, that builder is left as it is and `Player.log` names it."
msgstr "**修复。** 在游戏的 33 个构建函数里（物品、窗口、库存、机器面板及其小部件），132 种部件直接在所属位置生成，游戏自己的移动随后发现它们已经在位。部件最终的父节点、在兄弟节点中的位置，以及位置、旋转和缩放都和以前一样，启动方式也一样，因为它所在的一切都是同一个构建函数刚生成的，而且都处于激活状态。每个构建函数的第一个部件照旧生成。如果游戏更新改变了某个构建函数以这种方式生成的部件数，该构建函数保持原样，`Player.log` 会写出它的名字。"

#: manual/inventories.md:37
msgid "Loading the 1,342-item store creates 20,053 parts in place. With this and the option above, the same save loaded in about 2.8 s instead of about 6 s, with the same items in every inventory."
msgstr "读取 1,342 件物品的店铺时，原地生成 20,053 个部件。加上上面的选项，同一个存档的读档从约 6 秒降到约 2.8 秒，每个库存里的物品都相同。"

#: manual/inventories.md:41
msgid "**Problem.** Every tag change and every move works out the item's shape and state again: about 58,000 times while the 1,342-item store loads, mostly while each item is being made. Each time, the game searches everything under the item for inventories whose items change its shape or state, and builds a list, a set and a queue for the search. Most items have nothing under them at that point, no inventory window and no examine window, and the search finds nothing."
msgstr "**问题。** 每次标签变化和每次移动都会重新计算物品的形状和状态：读取 1,342 件物品的店铺时约 58,000 次，大多发生在生成每件物品的过程中。每次游戏都会在物品下面查找会改变它形状或状态的库存，并为此建一个列表、一个集合和一个队列。这时大多数物品下面什么都没有，既没有库存窗口也没有查看窗口，查找什么也找不到。"

#: manual/inventories.md:43
msgid "**Fix.** For an item with nothing under it, the search is skipped and gives the same empty answer. Everything else in the computation runs as before, and an item with anything under it is searched as before. While the store loads, 56,211 of the 58,148 searches are skipped."
msgstr "**修复。** 对下面什么都没有的物品，跳过查找，给出同样的空结果。计算中的其他部分照旧运行，下面有东西的物品照旧查找。读取店铺时，58,148 次查找中跳过了 56,211 次。"

#: manual/loading.md:3
msgid "Loading a save goes through three stages: the store's scene is set up, the save is read and its items are made, and the first frame is drawn. The fixes on this page and in [Inventories](inventories.md) remove work from the last two. Setting up the scene is almost all Unity's own work and is left as it is."
msgstr "读档分三个阶段：搭建商店场景、读取存档并生成其中的物品、画出首帧。本页和[库存](inventories.md)中的修复去掉的是后两个阶段的工作。搭建场景几乎全是 Unity 自己的工作，保持原样。"

#: manual/loading.md:5
msgid "On a store of 1,342 items, starting the game fresh before each load and loading the same save each time:"
msgstr "在 1,342 件物品的店铺上，每次读档前都重启游戏、每次读同一个存档："

#: manual/loading.md:7
msgid "Click to first frame"
msgstr "从点击到首帧"

#: manual/loading.md:9
msgid "Without this mod"
msgstr "不用此模组"

#: manual/loading.md:9
msgid "about 7.8 s and 8.2 s"
msgstr "约 7.8 秒和 8.2 秒"

#: manual/loading.md:10
msgid "4.64 s and 4.77 s"
msgstr "4.64 秒和 4.77 秒"

#: manual/loading.md:12
msgid "The times with this mod come from its own load timeline (see [Diagnostics](diagnostics.md)). Without the mod there is no timeline, so those times come from the game's stall watchdog, which logged the main thread blocked for 7.5 s and 7.9 s, plus the 0.3 s that the two logs differ by on loads where both were written."
msgstr "用此模组时的时间来自它自己的读档时间线（见[诊断](diagnostics.md)）。不用此模组时没有时间线，所以这些时间来自游戏的卡顿监视器：它记录主线程卡住了 7.5 秒和 7.9 秒，再加上 0.3 秒，即两者都有记录的读档中两份日志的差值。"

#: manual/loading.md:16
msgid "**Problem.** Almost all of a save is one entry, the store, which holds the contents of every inventory: 13 MB for this store. Before the save loads, the game reads that whole entry once just to see whether the display case and the fixtures are upgraded, and then drops it. The real load reads it again."
msgstr "**问题。** 存档几乎全是一项：商店，里面装着每个库存的内容，这个商店有 13 MB。读档之前，游戏会把这一整项读一遍，只为看展示柜和陈设是否升级过，然后就丢掉。真正读档时再读一遍。"

#: manual/loading.md:18
msgid "**Fix.** That early look now reads only the store's upgrades. Easy Save, the game's save system, is told for the moment that the store has only that one field, so it reads the upgrades exactly as before and passes over the rest, as it does with any field it does not know. Nothing else of the early copy was ever read. The real load is not changed."
msgstr "**修复。** 这次提前查看现在只读商店的升级。暂时告诉游戏的存档系统 Easy Save，商店只有这一个字段，于是它照原样读出升级，跳过其余部分，就像对待任何它不认识的字段一样。提前读出的副本里，其他内容从来没有被读过。真正的读档不变。"

#: manual/loading.md:22
msgid "**Problem.** Each time you enter the store, the game writes each of its settings and each key binding to its settings file one at a time: 57 writes. Each write reads the whole file, puts in the one value, writes a new file and swaps it in, and nearly every value written is the one already in the file. This took about half a second of every load."
msgstr "**问题。** 每次进入商店，游戏都把每项设置和每个按键绑定逐个写入设置文件：共 57 次。每次写入都要读整个文件、放进这一个值、写一个新文件再替换，而写入的几乎都是文件里已有的值。每次读档这要花约半秒。"

#: manual/loading.md:24
msgid "**Fix.** Before each of those writes, the value is read back from the file with the same settings the game writes it with. If the file already holds that value, the write is left out, since it would give the same file. A setting that is missing, different or cannot be read back is written exactly as before. Writes anywhere else, including rebinding a key in the options, are not changed."
msgstr "**修复。** 每次写入之前，先用游戏写入时同样的设置把值从文件里读回来。如果文件里已经是这个值，就不写，因为写了文件也一样。缺少、不同或读不回来的设置照原样写入。其他地方的写入，包括在选项里重新绑定按键，都不变。"

#: manual/loading.md:28
msgid "**Problem.** A store's items, inventories and windows all point at each other, so one reference to any of them kept anywhere keeps the whole store in memory. After leaving the store, for the main menu say, several such references stayed: the lookup tables of the last save, the list of window roots, the game's `current` and `Instance` fields of the store's managers, and some caches. Each load in the same session then started with the previous store still in memory."
msgstr "**问题。** 商店里的物品、库存和窗口彼此相互引用，所以任何地方保留了其中任何一个的引用，都会让整个商店留在内存里。离开商店后（例如回到主菜单），有几处这样的引用一直留着：上次存档的查找表、窗口根节点列表、游戏里商店各管理器的 `current` 和 `Instance` 字段，以及一些缓存。于是同一局游戏里的每次读档开始时，上一个商店都还在内存里。"

#: manual/loading.md:30
msgid "**Fix.** When another scene replaces the store, these are let go and memory is collected once while the menu is idle. Each reference is cleared only where the game no longer reads it: the save tables are replaced as at the start of every save and load, only windows already destroyed are taken off the list, and a manager field is cleared only while it points at a destroyed manager, which Unity already treats as nothing. `Player.log` gets one line with the memory before and after."
msgstr "**修复。** 当别的场景替换商店时，放开这些引用，并在菜单空闲时回收一次内存。每处引用只在游戏不再读取它的地方才清掉：存档查找表照每次存档和读档开始时那样替换，只把已经销毁的窗口移出列表，管理器字段只在它指向已销毁的管理器时才清掉，而 Unity 本来就把这种情况视为空。`Player.log` 会写一行释放前后的内存。"

#: manual/windows.md:3
msgid "Four fixes make opening and closing full storage windows smooth. They were found with the profiler: the storage-preset hotkey, which opens four full windows at once, froze the game for about 300 ms."
msgstr "四项修复让满载储物窗口的打开和关闭变得流畅。它们都是用分析器找到的：存储预设快捷键一次打开四个满载窗口，曾让游戏卡住约 300 毫秒。"

#: manual/windows.md:7
msgid "**Problem.** The game puts every floating window under one canvas, `FloatingWindowCanvas`. Unity rebuilds a canvas as a whole: whenever anything in it changes, every graphic in every open window is re-batched. A window opening, an item moving or a slot lighting up under the mouse is enough. With a few large storage windows open, that is thousands of graphics per change."
msgstr "**问题。** 游戏把所有浮动窗口都放在同一个画布 `FloatingWindowCanvas` 下。Unity 会整块重建画布：里面任何东西变化，所有打开窗口里的每个图形都要重新合批。打开一个窗口、挪动一件物品、鼠标下的格子亮起，都会触发。同时开着几个大型储物窗口时，每次变化就是成千上万个图形。"

#: manual/windows.md:9
msgid "**Fix.** Before a container window is shown, it gets a nested canvas, so a change inside it rebuilds only that window. The nested canvas keeps the parent's draw order, copies the root's reference pixels-per-unit and shader channels so sprites and text look the same, and has its own raycaster so its contents still take clicks."
msgstr "**修复。** 容器窗口显示之前，先给它加一个子画布，这样它内部的变化只会重建这个窗口。子画布保持父级的绘制顺序，复制根画布的像素比例和着色器通道，让贴图和文字外观不变，并带有自己的射线检测器，里面的内容照常可以点击。"

#: manual/windows.md:11
msgid "The game finds window bounds through `Canvas.rootCanvas` and positions windows with its own window canvas, so placement and dragging are unaffected. Tooltips and menus are left alone."
msgstr "游戏通过 `Canvas.rootCanvas` 获取窗口边界，并用自己的窗口画布定位窗口，所以位置和拖动都不受影响。提示框和菜单保持原样。"

#: manual/windows.md:15
msgid "**Problem.** When a window opens, the game moves it from its home, the scene's window canvas, under the floating-window canvas (`UIFamilyLayer.Adopt`). When it closes, the game moves it back (`ReleaseWindow`). Moving a hierarchy between canvases makes every graphic and text in it re-register and rebuild, so a full storage window costs tens of milliseconds each way. This was about 140 ms of the 280 ms preset stutter."
msgstr "**问题。** 窗口打开时，游戏把它从原处（场景的窗口画布）移到浮动窗口画布下（`UIFamilyLayer.Adopt`）；关闭时再移回去（`ReleaseWindow`）。在画布之间移动一棵对象树，会让里面每个图形和文字都重新登记、重建，一个满载储物窗口每次搬动都要几十毫秒。在 280 毫秒的预设卡顿中，这部分约占 140 毫秒。"

#: manual/windows.md:17
msgid "**Fix.** A closed window stays under the floating canvas. The next time it opens, the game finds it already in place and only brings it to the front. A window is kept only when its home is in the same scene as the floating canvas, so a scene change destroys it together with its home, exactly as before. A window being destroyed goes home first as usual."
msgstr "**修复。** 关闭的窗口留在浮动画布下。下次打开时，游戏发现它已经在正确位置，只需把它调到最前。只有当窗口原处和浮动画布在同一个场景时才保留，所以换场景时它会和原处一起被销毁，与原来完全一样。窗口被销毁时照常先搬回原处。"

#: manual/windows.md:21
msgid "**Problem.** Hiding a window deactivates its GameObject, and showing it activates it again. For a full storage window that means thousands of components switched off and on again, about 110 ms for one large window each way."
msgstr "**问题。** 隐藏窗口会停用它的 GameObject，显示时再启用。对满载储物窗口来说，这意味着成千上万个组件被关闭再打开，一个大窗口每次约 110 毫秒。"

#: manual/windows.md:23
msgid "**Fix.** Switching off the window's own canvas hides it just as well and costs almost nothing: nothing is drawn, and its raycaster is off, so it takes no clicks. The game reads a window's state only through `PixelWindow.IsVisible` and changes it only in `Show` and `Hide`, so for container windows that have their own canvas and stay in place:"
msgstr "**修复。** 关掉窗口自己的画布同样能隐藏它，而且几乎没有开销：什么都不绘制，射线检测器也关闭，所以点不到它。游戏只通过 `PixelWindow.IsVisible` 读取窗口状态，也只在 `Show` 和 `Hide` 中改变它，因此对于拥有独立画布并原地保留的容器窗口："

#: manual/windows.md:25
msgid "`Hide` performs the game's own steps in the same order: it remembers the window position, releases the window and removes it from the open-window list. The only difference is that it switches the canvas off instead of deactivating the object."
msgstr "`Hide` 按原来的顺序执行游戏自己的步骤：记住窗口位置、释放窗口、从打开窗口列表中移除。唯一的区别是关掉画布，而不是停用对象。"

#: manual/windows.md:26
msgid "`Show` switches the canvas back on first. After that, the game's `SetActive(true)` finds the object already active and does nothing."
msgstr "`Show` 先重新打开画布。之后游戏调用 `SetActive(true)` 时，发现对象已经是启用状态，就什么都不做。"

#: manual/windows.md:27
msgid "`IsVisible` answers false for a window hidden this way."
msgstr "对以这种方式隐藏的窗口，`IsVisible` 返回 false。"

#: manual/windows.md:29
msgid "Each window still pays the full cost the first time it opens. Turning the option off restores every such window to an ordinary, deactivated one."
msgstr "每个窗口第一次打开时仍要付出完整开销。关掉这个选项会把所有以这种方式隐藏的窗口恢复成普通的停用状态。"

#: manual/windows.md:33
msgid "**Problem.** The storage-preset hotkey opens or closes every window of the preset in one frame, so any remaining cost freezes every animation for its whole length."
msgstr "**问题。** 存储预设快捷键在同一帧内开关预设中的所有窗口，所以剩下的开销会让所有动画在整个过程中停住。"

#: manual/windows.md:35
msgid "**Fix.** The first window opens or closes at once, so the key answers immediately, and the others follow on the next frames, one each. Each window's tab selection is applied right after its own opening, as the game does. Pressing the hotkey again while some are still pending finishes them first, so the game always sees a settled state."
msgstr "**修复。** 第一个窗口立即打开或关闭，按键马上有反应，其余窗口在之后的帧里每帧处理一个。每个窗口的标签页选择紧跟在它自己打开之后应用，和游戏原来的做法一致。如果还有窗口没处理完又按了快捷键，会先把剩下的处理完，保证游戏看到的状态始终一致。"

#~ msgid "UI parts per item (13)"
